## Review procedure

See [`docs/runbooks/content-proposal-review.md`](https://github.com/project42dev/orchard/blob/main/docs/runbooks/content-proposal-review.md) for the 9-point human review checklist.

1. Read the proposal and its packet
2. Verify the deterministic gates
3. Review the model stages for any red flags
4. Decide: accept or reject
5. Comment exactly **`Approved`** or **`Denied`** (just Comment, not Close):
   - **`Approved`** — publishes the content
   - **`Denied`** — rejects the content

The `orchard-human-review` workflow will:
1. Reply to confirm it received your decision
2. Record the publication or rejection
3. Close this issue automatically

You never touch a terminal. Just comment and wait for the confirmation reply.